+- EWLY F24原答：“Heal to 41 HP for the forced elite. No upgrade justifies entering at 20 HP; later campfires cannot rescue an earlier death.”（回41血进强制精英，20血不能靠未来营火挽救先前死亡。）休21兑现，仍败；未到未来火不预支。
